# CV tailoring workspace -- source is tracked, rendered output is not.
#
# Every PDF and DOCX here is generated from the root
# Dexter_Fernandes_Master_CV.md plus Dexter_Fernandes_Resume_template.html.
# Re-render with ./html2pdf.sh from the repo root instead of committing binaries:
# git cannot diff them, so each re-render would add a full copy to history.

# --- Rendered CVs and cover letters ------------------------------------
**/Resumes/pdf/*
**/Resumes/docx/*
**/Resumes/HTML/*
/JDs/
**/Cover Letters/*
**/Form Answers/*

# A reference document, not a generated CV. Uncomment to track it.
# !CV/Cover Letters/Masters-degree-calculator.pdf

# --- Office / LibreOffice lock and owner files -------------------------
~$*
.~lock.*#
*.tmp

# --- OS cruft ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*:Zone.Identifier

# --- Editors -----------------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Claude Code / Codex ----------------------------------------------
# AGENTS.md, the CLAUDE.md symlink, .claude/skills and the .agents/ (Codex
# skill symlink) are shared and stay tracked.
# Machine-local settings and session state are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json

**/*.woff2
**/*.css
